# Large + adversarial fixtures fetched / generated by
# scripts/fetch_test_corpus.sh. Tests skip cleanly when absent
# (`openOrSkip` returns error.SkipZigTest), so CI fetches them on
# the test-corpus path while the default `zig build test` stays
# repo-only.
#
# Anything not in the explicit allow-list below is ignored.
*

!.gitignore
!frictionless_2sheets.xlsx
!openpyxl_guess_types.xlsx
!phpoi_test1.xlsx
!worldbank_catalog.xlsx
